<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">2TH</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TH</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TH</para>
  <para style="mt">2TH</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Cikarigo cina ci sirya pa Bulus, Sila na Timoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Korwa pa coci una u yiwa na Tasalonika una usa u Hwinsu Buca abuci hinda Bugwama bu duniya Yesu Kristi:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />iyi burya̠ ina isire pa Hwinsu Buca a buci hinda na Bugwama bu duniya Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gojiya na ahunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />U kamace ci goji Hwinsu zwama ga̠hi, ahun, hinda usa harbuni, zwama itano nihin i suwa i yiwa na majidana monso, hinda maka̠la̠ mana ma ga̠hi ima kalangi mayiwa na majidagana. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Zwama haruni, na aco na yiwa ne lagan Hwinsu ci yiwa ne ia̠go cikibi na ganhin zwama hankuri nuhin hinda na itano i suwa na wahala na igwaju una ganhin iyiwa na eago hankuri nuba. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ka̱mu uni u cibe cikarigo ci Hwinsu cisa kamahinda, hinda ai rutag pa aco na ai ese cigwama ci Hwinsu, una usa gahin i yiwa na so wahala. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Hwinsu usa u burya̠: Wai cupye iwo ina aba ai ia̱gi <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />hinda ui pan ilabco i suwa pa aco na ese damuwa, ka̱mu na ga̱ci ma. Iniya i eago hona Buca̠ bu yaba yesu aba ai hyan bware na zaro na ula u koce na acuma a Hwinsu. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Hwinsu ui pan aco na ai daku Hwinsu wahala hinda ai yajuwa na cikarigo ci Bugwama bu dwoniya Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Ai pan ga wahala una uza ihogu hinda ai ance ga pa ihug i Bugwama bu duniya hinda pa koce izangacu i uba <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />hon na uba yiwa na korwa zwama izangacu ya aco na za magwata hinda an pan aco na a yaje na Yesu. Uni usa hal ma na ganhin, zwama bu sa sheda nuci pa gahin. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Zwama haruni na suwa, ciyiwa tonoho na ea anhuda, ana Hwinsu ui rutage pa aco na a yaje ogo woba, hinda pa koce Hwinsu u sinji na kanmu i burya̠ nuhin ina i sirya zwama iyajo nuhin. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ahunda naci baniya inga iziya i Bugwama bu duniya Yesu ai hyan izangacu i uba ahwahin hinda ahwahin pa uba, zwama i burya̠ i Hwinsu na Bugwama bu duniya Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Bugwama bu Tawaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Zwama cikarigo ci uringuwo u Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi inga ga̱ci ci matanaga, ahun naciye, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Itama junguta na mabuna ko iyaje na cicagiya cikarigo ca acagiya acubago, ko ruhoto ko wasika ko da wa kurya pa ga̱ci, uba na zwamaga ana Buca̱ bu yaba bu riganu bua kurwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ita curya bucahya bui rudi ko naya, zwamu Hwinsuniya uza ikure kwa aiyi tawaye kwa bugwama bu eewo busire, buco buna aba shiri bwa pa yaba ula. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Buna busa bu gaba bwe danda ico buba bu i gaba kanmu ina aba uga Hwinsu ko hinda ina aba pagano cilabe, hal buma daliya na iganga labe i Hwinsu, buba nai zwama ana bubiya busa Hwinsu. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ashe ima butarega lokaci ana gya na zwamagana i niya? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Baniya i daki ina gazga bware na kurwo, zwama a cibiya bo daidai na lokaci abuba. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Zwamu asiri a kuce abuba a eewo a rigyano a paro ibwana; amma buna buyiwa nai gazgana bwe re gaba nai gazgana bwa hal kwa Hwinsu uzagaci bwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Na lokaci uni aba i cibai bugwama bu eewo, buna bugwama bu duniya Yesu aba i hune na muhunjua mu uno wuba hinda bu hone bwa na silacumo ya cilabe ci uba cikurwa uba. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Idaki kurwa wu bugwama bu tawaye zwamu na ibwana ya buco bu iwo na mubwana mu alajabi, alama iko wab iri-iri, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Hinda ayuwa ne ruda aco dinya ana yiwa na yina a u'o. Zwamu a wanje yaje na maka̠la̠ ma cikarigo ci kamahinda a hin icagago. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Zwama haruniya Hwinsu wi cumagyaga na rudu zwamu a yaje na cibe. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Zwamu a ia̠giga kamu hukunci ana wonje yaje na kamahinda ama a huge laco eewo.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisana Na burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ama u i gama tunoho ci goji Hwinsu zwama ga̠hi, ahun namui ana Buca̠ bu yaba buba ka̱ri, zwamu tun na jigo Hwinsu uba wi tanga, zwama ga̠hi i hin icagagu zwama iguzagu anhuru a burya̠ hinda na yajo na kamahinda. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Hwinsu ui uga na ihogo i cikarigiwo ci kamahinda, zwamu ga̱hi i hin izangacu iyuwa pa Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Zwamu haruniya, ahun namui, yisanaje na burya̠ ikumgage icibago ina ga̱ci ci cibage, ko na uno ko nabiya na utakarda. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />To Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi na icwa yoba na Hwinsu Buca̠ abuci, buna buci ka̱ri pa alheri uba ucipa ta'aziya ana aza ihogu na bege a burya̠ . <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />Wi ia̠gi ta'aziya a soo hinda na pano nihi kuce na yegu iye burya̠ na numa uyuba.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">I kabanu Ya Hunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Na hogu kamu, ahun nimui, cihyegija ahunda zwama cikarigiwo ci Buca̠ bu yaba ciba ci sinje duniye na mabuna hinda a pace cilabe, inga ciba yiwa pa ga̠hi. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Hinda i'iyi ahunda zwam aci cage na siwa sa aco mugota na iwo, zwama sa ka̠mu wa aco a za iyajo. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Amma Buca̠ bu yaba busa bu burya̠ , bwepana kuce hinda bui tala buco bu iwo. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Ciyage na kuce bugwama bu duniya hinda iyuwa na lagana ina gaci cizwama ire gaba na hye iyi burya̠ ina gaci ci cibagye. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Buca̱ bu yaba bo laga suwa ali na yina u burya̠ u Hwinsu na maka̠la̠ man ma yiwa na Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igazganu na dala Kawuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Na izi Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi, cipa umurni, ahun nimui, i curi ka̱mu buhun buna bwa karuwa ibwana na cimere hinda bwama daluwa nga̱ cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ga̱hi ce pa gaci. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Zwama ga̱hi idaki umakaci ilaga cihano acici na misali nuci. Zwamu lokaci ana ga̱ci yanse na ga̱hin ci cibaguwa hali awo na uyago. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Cariwa mare ma buciyahe daje ca cupuwa. Kwadi ciso wahala dinyiya, na pama nai bwana zwama na cikaruwa cisa bucahya wahala. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ci ia̱gi haruniya, sa zwama ana ciza hal ci taimako iruniya, a'ye kwadi zwamu ga̱hi yi koyo pa gaci cisan gurbi nuhi buniya. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ko nga̱ ga̱ci yanse tare na ga̱hi, cipa umurni na: &lt;&lt;Si buco buza ni ia̱ga ibwana, bu za ire mare.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ci hoge aza aco na za uyago ia̱guwo ibwana. Aza na ibwana balle; kwa dai cizwama ci cagiya aco. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />To iri aco niya ci yuwa na pana umurni ci yiwa hinda na egega gargadi na ziya Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi a iyi ibwana na hankali a recumage sico saba. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Amma gahi, ahun nimui, ita nibaga nai hye iburya̠ . <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />si ciki nahi buwunje iyi biyyaya na ina gaci ci zwama na wasika una, ga̱hi uyi kula na buba. isume bwa, zwamu bu huge mu hye. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ka̱mu na haruni itazanga bwa aboki gaba ama ibutaga bwa buhun abuhi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibungago i kundata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />To Buca̱ bu yaba buna buza dala bware bwepa dala abwure a tamba lokaci. Buca̱ bu yaba bu hye na ga̱hi tumba lokaci. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Gya, Bulus, na rubuci i bungago na wa nimui, una ubiya usa sheda na tumba wasika harbuniya ge na egu rubuto. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />I burya̱ a Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi a yah tare na ga̱hi kamu.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>